<%#
  One note row. Clicking it opens the note full-pane (§7.7) — no turbo frame,
  so this is a plain navigation to the note's own URL and the back button
  works. The same note's card on the board opens the modal instead (§8.2);
  the surface follows where you clicked, never how long the note is (§8.4).

  Locals: note, root (a note with no folder, sitting at the tree's root).
%>
<%= link_to note_path(note),
      class: class_names("row", "row--note", "row--root" => local_assigns[:root],
                         "row--untitled" => note.title.blank?),
      "aria-current": (@note&.id == note.id ? "true" : nil) do %>
  <% if local_assigns[:root] %>
    <span class="row__twist" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <% end %>
  <span class="row__label"><%= note.tree_label %></span>
<% end %>
